            "review_title": "Review at The Gourmet Corner Restaurant Da Nang",
            "review_text": "Nils A\n2 contributions\n0\nFood made with love\nMar 2020 • Couples\nNoticed this romantic looking place on the corner and decided to have a meal with my other half. Friendly and thoughtful staff made us feel welcomed. Food exceeded our expectations and was surprisingly affordable for the fancy appearance. This place is perfect for groups or a casual date night. Thank you for brightening our day! :)\nRead more\nWritten March 16, 2020",
